  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The correct statement(s) for the following addition reactions is(are)<br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/ypmjgvmbcmykpbcdaacubvyccjddknovssmysochayfwuvzmwm.jpeg\"/></p>",
